
# Channel Configuration

Copy this file to channel-config.md and fill in your own values.
The youtube-video-generator plugin reads this file to personalize
every episode's end-card, metadata footer, and publish schedule.

Never commit channel-config.md to git if it contains personal information.
The .gitignore already excludes it.

---

## Channel Identity

Channel Name: Your Channel Name
Channel Tagline: Your short tagline or series name

## Social Links

LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/your-handle
Medium: https://medium.com/@your-handle
X: https://x.com/your-handle
GitHub: https://github.com/your-username/your-repo
Website: https://your-site.com

## Publish Schedule

Short beginner content: Tuesday / Thursday / Saturday / Sunday, 8 to 9 PM your local time
Long advanced content: Saturday, 9 to 10 AM your local time

## End Card

Channel wordmark text: YOUR CHANNEL NAME
Series tag: YOUR SERIES NAME
CTA line: FOLLOW FOR THE NEXT EPISODE

## Channel Icon Overlay

Text line 1: Your Channel Name
Text line 2: Your Series Name
Badge color: dark pill, green border (default) or change to match your brand
